  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759172,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100-in-1 Contra Function 16 - NES\n\nPrepare for an overwhelming onslaught of action with *100-in-1 Contra Function 16*! This massive multicart delivers a staggering collection of NES games, primarily focusing on run-and-gun shooters and action-packed platformers, many of which are unique rom hacks and modifications of classic titles. \n\nWhile not a single, cohesive game, the cartridge offers a diverse range of experiences, from frantic, side-scrolling shooters reminiscent of *Contra* to challenging platformers with inventive level design. Expect intense gameplay, demanding boss battles, and a constant stream of enemies.  \n\nMany of the included games feature altered graphics, gameplay mechanics, and even entirely new levels, providing a fresh take on familiar NES experiences.  While the quality of each individual game varies, the sheer volume and variety guarantee hours of retro gaming enjoyment.  It’s a chaotic, thrilling, and utterly addictive compilation perfect for fans of classic NES action.  Prepare to test your reflexes and endurance!"
    },
